    {
      "id": "2026-11-04-s1",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "anime",
      "title_zh": "我的爱好",
      "title_en": "My hobby",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "的", "爱好", "是", "看", "日本", "电影", "。", "我", "常常", "一边", "看", "，", "一边", "学", "新", "的", "话", "。"],
        ["朋友", "问", "我", "：", "“", "看", "电影", "有用", "吗", "？", "”"],
        ["我", "说", "：", "“", "很", "有用", "！", "我", "现在", "能", "听", "明白", "很", "多", "话", "了", "。", "”"],
        ["下", "个", "月", "，", "我", "想", "去", "日本", "玩", "。", "我", "在", "网上", "看", "了", "很", "多", "地方", "。"],
        ["我", "觉得", "，", "我", "能", "跟", "那里", "的", "人", "说话", "了", "！", "我", "很", "高兴", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "My hobby is watching Japanese films. I often pick up new words while I watch.",
        "My friend asked me: “Is watching films actually useful?”",
        "I said: “Very useful! Now I can understand a lot of what people say.”",
        "Next month I want to go to Japan. I’ve looked at lots of places online.",
        "I think I’ll be able to talk to people there! I’m really happy."
      ],
      "names": ["日本"],
      "new_words": ["爱好", "有用"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "爱好", "english": "hobby" },
        { "word": "有用", "english": "useful" },
        { "word": "日本", "english": "Japan" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "2026-11-04-s2",
      "level": 1,
      "topic": "archive fashion",
      "title_zh": "不大的地方",
      "title_en": "A small place",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["我", "家", "旁边", "有", "一", "个", "地方", "，", "那里", "都", "是", "老", "衣服", "。", "我", "常常", "去", "那里", "看", "看", "。"],
        ["那里", "不大", "，", "衣服", "很", "多", "。", "左边", "是", "包", "，", "右边", "是", "衣服", "。"],
        ["今天", "，", "我", "在", "那里", "找到", "了", "一", "个", "二十", "年", "前", "的", "包", "，", "要", "一百", "块", "。", "我", "一", "看", "就", "很", "喜欢", "。"],
        ["我", "很", "高兴", "，", "午饭", "也", "没", "吃", "，", "就", "拿", "着", "包", "回家", "了", "。"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "There’s a place next to my home that’s full of vintage clothes. I often go and have a look.",
        "It isn't big, but there are loads of clothes. Bags are on the left, clothes on the right.",
        "Today I found a twenty-year-old bag there for a hundred kuai. I loved it at first sight.",
        "I was so happy that I skipped lunch and went straight home with the bag."
      ],
      "names": [],
      "new_words": ["不大", "左边", "午饭"],
      "glossary": [
        { "word": "不大", "english": "not big" },
        { "word": "左边", "english": "on the left" },
        { "word": "午饭", "english": "lunch" }
      ]
    }
